     A*****                                 SKIPB(8)
     A*****                               47'Ullico Insurance Company-
     A*****                                 ''s Privacy Policy'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SKIPB(10)
     A*****                               10'Dear Policyholder:'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SKIPB(13)
     A*****                               10'The nature of our insurance -
     A*****                                 business at Ullico -
     A*****                                 Insurance Company requires -
     A*****                                 that we gather and maintain a -
     A*****                                 variety'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               10'of information about our -
     A*****                                 current and potential -
     A*****                                 customers and consumers, -
     A*****                                 including nonpublic personal -
     A*****                                 information about'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'individuals.  We are -
     A*****                                 committed to keeping -
     A*****                                 confidential and secure any -
     A*****                                 such nonpublic personal -
     A*****                                 information.  We will'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'disclose nonpublic personal -
     A*****                                 information obtained in the -
     A*****                                 course of our business only -
     A*****                                 as permitted by law.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'Categories of Personal -
     A*****                                 Information We May Obtain'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               10'We may obtain nonpublic -
     A*****                                 personal information from the -
     A*****                                 following sources:'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               12'-'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               15'Application or other -
     A*****                                 underwriting forms.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                               56'These forms provide us with -
     A*****                                 information we need as part of -
     A*****                                 the'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                               15'underwriting process; this -
     A*****                                 can include such nonpublic -
     A*****                                 personal information as -
     A*****                                 individuals'' names, addresses,'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'social security numbers and -
     A*****                                 any other information about -
     A*****                                 individuals that we are -
     A*****                                 authorized to obtain in order -
     A*****                                 to'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'underwrite and administer -
     A*****                                 policies.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               12'-'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               15'Information we obtain from -
     A*****                                 third parties.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                               56'The kind of information we -
     A*****                                 may gather from third parties -
     A*****                                 depends on'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                               15'the type of insurance policy -
     A*****                                 or coverage, but may include -
     A*****                                 such nonpublic personal -
     A*****                                 information as motor vehicle'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'reports, claims reports, -
     A*****                                 credit reports, property -
     A*****                                 inspection reports, and -
     A*****                                 medical records or reports.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               12'-'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               15'Information about -
     A*****                                 transactions and experiences -
     A*****                                 with us or with our affiliates.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                               93'We develop and maintain'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                               15'individuals'' personal -
     A*****                                 information, such as policy -
     A*****                                 numbers, premium payments and -
     A*****                                 claims history, obtained on the'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'basis of Ullico Insurance -
     A*****                                 Company''s or its affiliates -
     A*****                                 transactions and experiences.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'How We May Use and Share -
     A*****                                 Personal Information'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               10'We may use and share all of -
     A*****                                 the information that we obtain -
     A*****                                 as described below:'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               12'-'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               15'Within Ullico Insurance -
     A*****                                 Company'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                               15'Within Ullico Insurance -
     A*****                                 Company we only use nonpublic -
     A*****                                 personal information received -
     A*****                                 to service or maintain'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               15'policies, to effect, process, -
     A*****                                 administer or enforce -
     A*****                                 requested or authorized -
     A*****                                 transactions, or for other -
     A*****                                 purposes as'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'permitted by law.  We -
     A*****                                 restrict access to nonpublic -
     A*****                                 personal information to those -
     A*****                                 employees who have a business'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'reason to know that -
     A*****                                 information to provide -
     A*****                                 products and services.  We -
     A*****                                 also maintain physical, -
     A*****                                 electronic, and'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'procedural safeguards in -
     A*****                                 order to protect against -
     A*****                                 unauthorized use or disclosure -
     A*****                                 of nonpublic personal'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'information.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               12'-'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               15'With Affiliates and -
     A*****                                 Non-Affiliated Third Parties'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                               15'We may disclose information -
     A*****                                 about Ullico Insurance -
     A*****                                 Company''s customers and -
     A*****                                 consumers to others,'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               15'including our affiliates -
     A*****                                 (i.e. companies that are -
     A*****                                 related to us by common -
     A*****                                 ownership or control), in -
     A*****                                 order to offer'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'insurance products or -
     A*****                                 services that may be of value.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'We may also disclose -
     A*****                                 nonpublic personal information -
     A*****                                 without prior permission to -
     A*****                                 nonaffiliated third parties -
     A*****                                 (i.e.,'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               15'persons or -
     A*****                                 companies that are not -
     A*****                                 related to us by common -
     A*****                                 ownership or control) as -
     A*****                                 necessary to effect, process,'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'administer or enforce a -
     A*****                                 requested or authorized -
     A*****                                 transaction, or for other -
     A*****                                 purposes as permitted by law.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'When we provide nonpublic -
     A*****                                 personal information to a -
     A*****                                 nonaffiliated third party who -
     A*****                                 performs services for us, we'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               15'require that provider to -
     A*****                                 agree to safeguard any -
     A*****                                 nonpublic personal -
     A*****                                 information, to use the -
     A*****                                 information only for the'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               15'intended purpose, and to -
     A*****                                 abide by applicable law.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'Confidentiality of Health -
     A*****                                 and Medical Information'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               10'It is often necessary for us -
     A*****                                 to obtain personal health -
     A*****                                 information in order to -
     A*****                                 underwrite and process claims -
     A*****                                 for various'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               10'types of insurance coverages. -
     A*****                                  We recognize concerns about -
     A*****                                 the security of that -
     A*****                                 information and want to -
     A*****                                 provide'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'assurance that any personal -
     A*****                                 health data provided to us or -
     A*****                                 that we otherwise obtain will -
     A*****                                 be held in strict confidence.  -
     A*****                                 We'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'will not disclose or share -
     A*****                                 personal medical information -
     A*****                                 for marketing or any other -
     A*****                                 unauthorized purpose.  We may'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'disclose or share personal -
     A*****                                 medical information as -
     A*****                                 permitted by law; for -
     A*****                                 example, in order to -
     A*****                                 underwrite policies or'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'administer policies or -
     A*****                                 claims.'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'Purpose of and Updates to -
     A*****                                 This Notice'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H40000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               10'We recognize and respect the -
     A*****                                 privacy concerns of our -
     A*****                                 potential and current -
     A*****                                 customers and consumers.  We -
     A*****                                 may amend'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(2)
     A*****                               10'our privacy policy from time -
     A*****                                 to time.  We send this notice -
     A*****                                 of our privacy policy at this -
     A*****                                 time as required for -
     A*****                                 informational'
     A*****                                 FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A*****                                 SPACEB(1)
     A*****                               10'purposes, and we will update -
     A*****                                 and distribute it as required -
     A*****                                 by law.'
